but it terrified me, it did.

00:11:05.407 --> 00:11:07.350
"Nightmare on Elm Street" was your jam?

00:11:07.350 --> 00:11:08.183
- Freddy's hilarious.

00:11:08.183 --> 00:11:09.480
(audience laughing)

00:11:09.480 --> 00:11:11.400
Freddy's always ready with a quip right

00:11:11.400 --> 00:11:12.789
