- He was, okay.

00:11:12.789 --> 00:11:14.820
- He's kind of king of
the one-liners, isn't he?

00:11:14.820 --> 00:11:16.410
- That's, yes, I think he might've been

00:11:16.410 --> 00:11:18.450
one of my greatest
inspirations as a writer.

00:11:18.450 --> 00:11:19.710
- [Kelly] Oh my gosh.
- Yeah.

00:11:19.710 --> 00:11:21.495
- One of my greatest
inspirations for nightmares.

00:11:21.495 --> 00:11:22.590
(all laughing)
Yeah, yeah.

00:11:22.590 --> 00:11:23.686
Like I didn't sleep

00:11:23.686 --> 00:11:24.519
for two years.
- You were normal,

00:11:24.519 --> 00:11:25.410
that was the point.

00:11:25.410 --> 00:11:27.510
- I was like, "This is
scary," and probably,

00:11:27.510 --> 00:11:28.800
my brother's like a decade older,

00:11:28.800 --> 00:11:30.347
so I probably shouldn't
have been watching it.

00:11:30.347 --> 00:11:34.170
Well, we've got a game about
